For every UI task:

1. Build using the existing Flask + Jinja architecture.
2. Do not introduce React, Next.js, or Vite.
3. Use Tailwind CSS and reusable HTML/Jinja components.
4. Use Context7 when library/API documentation is needed.
5. Use Playwright to inspect the actual running application.
6. Run the UI/UX design audit after implementation.
7. Fix the highest-impact audit findings.
8. Check responsive behavior at mobile, tablet, and desktop widths.
9. Check accessibility, contrast, typography, spacing, hierarchy,
   alignment, consistency, and interaction states.
10. Re-run the audit and Playwright after fixes.
11. Do not consider the task finished until the UI is polished.
